flowchart LR
  Caller[Caller] --> Vapi[Vapi Voice Provider\nSTT + LLM + TTS]
  Vapi --> Browser[React/Vite Session UI]
  Browser -->|client messages\ntranscript + tool activity| Session[Session Reducer\nstatus + transcript + timers]
  Vapi -->|tool calls| Public[Stable HTTPS Ingress\nCloudflare or cloud load balancer]
  Vapi -->|end-of-call report| Public
  Public --> API[FastAPI Runtime]
  API --> Identity[Trusted Tenant /\nDeployment Resolver]
  API --> Budget[Tool Gateway\nvalidation + budgets + timeout\nretry + circuit breaker]
  Budget --> Tools[Domain Tools\nnormalize identifier\nlookup customer\nverify identity]
  Tools --> Repo{Repository Adapter}
  Repo --> JSON[JSON Fixtures\nlocal development]
  Repo --> SQL[MySQL / TiDB\nproduction]
  API --> Ledger[Canonical Call +\nEvent Ledger]
  API --> Outcome[Call Outcome\nstatus + reason + linkage  API --> Outcome[Call Outcome\nstatus + reason + lin+ owner]
  Admin[Tenant Admin\n/admin] --> Config[Tenant Config\nprompt + tools + policy + version]
  Config --> SQL
  Config --> Provider[Provider Adapter Factory]
  Provider --> Vapi
  Outcome --> Metrics[Structured Metrics\nlatency + errors + funnel]

